{"slug": "fort-lauderdale-international-boat-show-hotels", "title": "Fort Lauderdale International Boat Show Hotels", "description": "The Fort Lauderdale International Boat Show, also known as FLIBS, is the largest boat show in the world! This five-day event showcases more world and U.S. debuts than any other boat show in the country, which is why over 100,000 people attend each year. Across its seven located in Fort Lauderdale, the show has 1,000 exhibiting brands and over 1,300 boats on display.", "date": "2022-10-05", "category": "Boat Shows & Events", "image": "https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/h1.jpg", "html": "<p>The <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/boat-show-in-fort-lauderdale-florida/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fort Lauderdale International Boat Show</a>, also known as FLIBS, is the largest boat show in the world! This five-day event showcases more world and U.S. debuts than any other boat show in the country, which is why over 100,000 people attend each year.</p><p>Across its seven located in Fort Lauderdale, the show has 1,000 exhibiting brands and over 1,300 boats on display.</p><p>With FLIBS coming up on <a href=\"https://fyiyachts.com/boat-show-in-fort-lauderdale-florida/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">October 26th</a>, it is important to find a hotel before they fill up.</p><p><strong>Below are some of our favorite hotels near the show:</strong></p><h2>Four Seasons Hotel and Residences Fort Lauderdale</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.fourseasons.com/fortlauderdale/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">525 North Fort Lauderdale Beach Boulevard, Fort Lauderdale, Fl 33304</a></p><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/4-SEAONS.jpg\" alt=\"Four Seasons Hotel and Residences Fort Lauderdale\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/fyiyachts/2022/10/4-SEASON-2.jpg\" alt=\"Four Seasons Hotel and Residences Fort Lauderdale\" loading=\"lazy\" /><img src=\"https:/